@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the [+ ccf_name +] to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; radical_strength += 10; radical_dissent -= 8; managerial_dissent += 3

We have increased the strength of the left faction with the [+ ccf_name +]. This raised concern among the moderate moderates in the party.

@cpc_s_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the CPC(S)
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the CPC(S) as well as the [+ ccf_name +].
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; radical_strength += 5; cpc_s_relation += 6*(1-dissent); managerial_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if cpc_s_cooperation_seen <= 1; cpc_s_cooperation_seen += 1

Fines attempts to reach out to his former colleagues to dissuade the CPC(S) from their current extreme Stalinist path. Some concessions are extracted.
